    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>258924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>浮かんでいる敵を狙っている時、
ステップしても空中に追いかけなくなる
スキルらしいだーよ

覚えさせたいキャラに使うとスキルが増えるだ。
だけんど、スキル書は消費アイテムだで、
１回使うとなくなっちまうから、よく考えれ

スキルを覚えさせた直後は、
使う状態（on）になってるだよ。
このon／offはメニューのスキルで設定できるだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seems like it's a Skill to stop you chasing your
targeted enemy into the sky, if you take a Step
while they're airborne.

Use it on whoever you want to learn it, and they'll
gain a skill. It's a consumable item, though, so be
sure and think long and hard before you go using it.

As soon as you've learned it, the skill'll be set to
"on," so you can use it lickety-split. You can turn it
off or back on whenever you like, in the Skill Menu.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>skill description may need editing, i translated it as the text reads but i feel like the text is kind of a shit explanation of what it's actually supposed to do</Notes>
